      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is only the first half of the UI update. Next will be the main menu, which they’ve said will likely show up early 2022.\nCheck the #open-beta-announcments channel in the VRChat Discord. \nI think they will be doing something like option 1 you came up with, giving the main menu a full redesign to better fit their new UI scheme.",
