      "statusChangeID": "616710aa9b86356a20cf278a",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This is already the plan!\nThis update is considered \"UI 1.5\", as we realized the quick menu would be in a releasable state before the new main menu was, but the plan is still to get the redone main menu out during a later \"UI 2.0\" update.\nFor the moment, the main menu has gotten a fresh coat of paint, with a few minor changes.\nFeel free to read the [Dev stream recap](https://medium.com/vrchat/vrchat-april-2021-dev-stream-recap-8502bb8c9163) if you want to know more.\nClosing this as it's \"out of scope\" for the 1.5 Open Beta, and already planned.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
