  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-13T00:13:52.557Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "After using this new launch pad menu honestly its a fresh breathe of air. This is something I've been waiting for ever, since you guys first announced your new launch pad menu on twitch the first time years ago. Now that it seems like a new version of that menu is here, its honestly great 0 complaints. But one thing i do have to say is the menu you see after you click a button like worlds or avatars, I feel like that menu kinda needs a good face lift as well, cause it just still looks like the old menu style but, the colours were changed. I feel like you guys should do 2 options, 1. make a whole new menu entirely that has the same style as the new launch pad menu. 2. try to get rid of that menu and integrate all the functionality that menu has with the new launch pad menu, basically making it all into 1 menu instead of having 2 menus.",
